---
import Layout from "@layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "@components/container.astro";
import Sectionhead from "@components/sectionhead.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy">
  <Container>
    <Sectionhead>
      <Fragment slot="title">Privacy Policy</Fragment>
      <Fragment slot="desc">Your privacy is important to us.</Fragment>
    </Sectionhead>

    <div class="mt-10 text-slate-600 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">1. Introduction</h2>
<p>At Tech in Teach Academy, we empower educators worldwide with innovative training programs. Your privacy is central to our mission, and we are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, share, and safeguard your data when you visit our website https://techinteach.com or use our services. By accessing our website or services, you agree to the terms of this Privacy Policy.</p>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">2. Information We Collect</h2>

<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl">2.1 Personal Data</h3>
<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4">
  <li>Contact Information: Name, email address, phone number, and mailing address (e.g., when you register for courses, subscribe to our newsletter, or contact us).</li>
  <li>Professional Information: Teaching credentials, certifications, or employment details to verify eligibility for courses or issue certifications.</li>
  <li>Payment Information: Credit card details or other payment data processed through secure third-party payment processors when you purchase courses.</li>
  <li>User-Provided Content: Feedback, comments, survey responses, or other information you share during training or on our website.</li>
</ul>

<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl">2.2 Usage Data</h3>
<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4">
  <li>Browsing behavior (e.g., pages visited, courses viewed)</li>
  <li>Course progress and completion</li>
  <li>Communication preferences (e.g., newsletter subscriptions)</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4">
  <li>Deliver and administer our courses and training programs</li>
  <li>Process payments and handle transactions</li>
  <li>Respond to inquiries and provide customer support</li>
  <li>Send promotional materials and updates about new courses</li>
  <li>Analyze usage patterns to improve our services</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">4. Sharing Your Information</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4">
  <li>Payment processors to facilitate transactions</li>
  <li>Service providers who help us operate and improve our platform</li>
  <li>Legal authorities if required by law</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">5. Data Security</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4">
  <li>Secure Socket Layer (SSL) encryption for data transmission</li>
  <li>Access controls to restrict unauthorized access</li>
  <li>Regular security audits and updates</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">6. Your Rights</h2>
<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4">
  <li>Access to your personal data</li>
  <li>Correction of inaccurate information</li>
  <li>Deletion of your data (subject to legal exceptions)</li>
  <li>Restriction of data processing</li>
  <li>Data portability</li>
  <li>Objection to certain types of processing</li>
  <li>Withdrawal of consent</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">7. International Data Transfers</h2>
<p>Your data may be transferred to and processed in the United States or other countries. We ensure compliance with applicable laws, including GDPR and India's DPDP Act, to provide equivalent protection regardless of location.</p>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">8. Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain your personal data only for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it was collected, including to comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and maintain security. Specifically:</p>
<ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-4">
  <li>User account and course data is retained indefinitely unless you request deletion.</li>
  <li>Payment information is retained for up to 7 years for tax and accounting purposes.</li>
  <li>Course progress and completion data is retained indefinitely to track your achievements.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">9. Links to Third-Party Websites</h2>
<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites, apps, or services. Clicking on these links may allow third parties to collect your personal information. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these third parties. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing any personal information.</p>

<h2 class="mt-12 text-3xl">10. Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact our Privacy Officer at:</p>
<p class="mt-4">
  Email: privacy@techinteach.com<br>
  Support Email: support@techinteach.com<br>
  Mailing Address: Tech in Teach Academy, 123 Educator Street, Tech City, CA 98765, USA<br>
  Website: <a href="https://techinteach.com/contact">https://techinteach.com/contact</a>
</p>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>
